'''Weeds''' can be found at the start and the ends of [[Chambers of Xeric]] floors. Players can rake the weeds to obtain [[buchu seed|buchu]], [[golpar seed|golpar]], or [[noxifer seed]]s. Once the player has started raking, they will continue to rake and obtain seeds until the action is cancelled. A [[rake]] is obtainable from the [[old tools]] found within the raid.

